的生活，除信任的人以外几乎不对他人表露心思。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一旦相处融洽后，会从心底信任对方。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11506"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/9558d0c086611a03bb7065e8a773d9f4e802b0a3e658776c4acaa505c94de924.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a488418ea456fa1b9a33a6f82fca39771b9b59a41a8fdb0d1464dd55997e8190.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大野 まりな","creatorId":"vndb:s1253","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1253","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1253","name":"大野 まりな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8055","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c6044","characterName":"ナーヤ＝トトカ・ナナフィ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11507","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"11258"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25900"],"vndbCharacterId":"c6044"},"originalCharacterName":"ナーヤ＝トトカ・ナナフィ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"74"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The President of \"Magic World\" and a member of \"Tacta\" family with cat-ears. While Naya is very young, she is a skilled engineer and possess great knowledge and maturity despite her looks. She can be clumsy at times, however. Naya gets along well with Ruputuna."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She's the reincarnation of the god Himeora."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6044"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「魔法の世界」の大統領、望たちと共闘する道を選ぶ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高いレベルの技術者で、情報戦のエキスパート。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旅団で一番年下だが大人びているところがあり、望に王道を説くこともある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来の性格は脳天気で破天荒、皆の予想を超える突拍子な行動に出ることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ルプトナはいつもナーヤに叱られ役。大食いで耳年増、ただしまったくの未経験。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25900","sourceWorkId":"7026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"永远神剑：第六位　『无垢』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"守护神兽：魔法机械「クロウランス」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『魔法世界』的大统领，选择了与望等人共同战斗的道路。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高水平的技术人员，情报战的专家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在旅团中年龄最小但言行像大人一般，并会向望讲述君王之道。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原本性格天真前所未闻，以明朗快乐为信条。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与ルプト意气相投。饭量大且性知识丰富，不过却完全没有经验。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11507"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d00485a6626877a7b6a4d2e5ee833dd6d87d80b7416650c97a4732cc467a1457.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/08a7e5e9c09de66df172e29256cfcefed7b8c04b95189a6395ca9ea8ae8f5549.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"本山 美奈","creatorId":"vndb:s1062","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1062","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1062","name":"黒河 奈美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8053","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c6087","characterName":"タリア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11509","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"11258"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17753"],"vndbCharacterId":"c6087"},"originalCharacterName":"タリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"最前線で戦う「旅団」の一員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"花を愛するような優しい性格だが、人前でそれを見せることは少なく、大抵は他人に厳しい態度を取る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"望たち新人に対して、あまり良い感情を持っていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ソルラスカとは犬猿の仲。潔癖性なところがある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17753","sourceWorkId":"7026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"永遠神獣：第六位「疾風」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"守護神獣：漂う泡"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「旅団」の一員で、最前線で戦う少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編での決戦後、多くの仲間は故郷へと戻ったが、彼女は「旅団」の主力として、平穏を脅かす存在と戦い続けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも側にいるソルラスカとは、相変わらず衝突ばかりの毎日。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17753","sourceWorkId":"11139","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"永远神剑：第六位　『疾风』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"守护神兽：大水母「浮泡」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在最前线战斗的「旅団」的一员。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽是喜爱花的温柔性格，一旦在「旅団」中听从サレス而战斗时，就会把原本的性格完全隐藏起来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"把望等人当作新人对待，没抱有什么好情感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与ソルラスカ水火不容，有洁癖症。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11509"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9e404fa6317f77321d6b0a51ea718635c35c8b2669ee59fcbb854452098beb4e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/45d487f910a54f1f351aab185601c520d3740f754e7a4bcad82642c1c4ae13d5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"韮井 叶","creatorId":"vndb:s1182","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1182","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1182","name":"韮井叶","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8054","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c6088","characterName":"ヤツィータ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11513","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"11258"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17757"],"vndbCharacterId":"c6088"},"originalCharacterName":"ヤツィータ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこかおっとりした雰囲気を持っているが、人をからかうのが好きな「旅団」のナンバー2。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"医学知識が豊富で、様々な医療技術を修得している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仲間に対して非常にやさしく献身的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は自分の過去が消滅しており、自らが何者であるか解らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、今の仲間が失われることをひどく怖がる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17757","sourceWorkId":"7026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"魅惑のボディが艶っぽい、「旅団」のお姉さま。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作では「～永遠神剣QUIZ～」の進行役として登場。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17757","sourceWorkId":"11139","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"永远神剑：第六位　『癒合』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"守護神獣：赤龙「炎翼バラスターダ」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然从某处散发出稳重的感觉，但其实是爱捉弄人的「旅団」的No.2。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"医学知识丰富，掌握着各种各样的医疗技术。队同伴非常温柔极具献身精神。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"而事实上因为失去了自己的过去，不知道自己是何人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因此，害怕失去现在的同伴。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11513"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/42a4f5f349d81f4a96041e0e9ed0be5f58a811f9c1ca3ef575310bca1bbb1d30.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fbcce26406413e798f770af13034b74fbfe0e2f6b9e739280f372525fd6cc1cd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"金田 まひる","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8051","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c8094","characterName":"世刻 望","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11499","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"11258"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25895"],"vndbCharacterId":"c8094"},"originalCharacterName":"世刻 望","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Protagonist of the game."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nozomu is a normal student at Mononobe Academy. His parents went missing when he was younger, so he was taken care of by Nozomi's parents. His peaceful life comes to an end, when his school is ambushed by group of \"Minions\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unbeknownst to him, power and destiny from his own past life continue to haunt him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c8094"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"破壊神としての前世を持つ物語の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"破壊神としての意識と戦いながら、人としての意識が消える前に問題を解決しなくては、と葛藤する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思慮深く真面目な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"問題を多角的に判断することがれき、自分が置かれている状況に恐怖を感じている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25895","sourceWorkId":"7026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"永远神剑：第五位　『黎明』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"守护神兽：天使型神兽「レーメ」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前世为破坏神的故事主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在与破坏神的意识抗争的同时，又要必须在人的意识消失之前解决问题，内心一直在这样纠缠着。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格认真深思熟虑。能多角度考虑问题，赌目前置身其中的状况感到恐惧。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11499"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/3201b0cefb8947c3c8b054a53fae367eba6492eff550456d09a80c4cd1eea93f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/6461fd799c175bb5e3b3303ddb73e11fc66616d30253e82b9bf839fa38e2557e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c8126","characterName":"サレス＝クウォークス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11508","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"11258"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25901"],"vndbCharacterId":"c8126"},"originalCharacterName":"サレス＝クウォークス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"望たちをまとめる「旅団」のリーダー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「光をもたらすもの」の全滅を目的として、危険な時間分枝を優先的に救おうと行動する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全てを見通すような瞳で、本心を見せることはなく指示以外はほとんど喋らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"目的を達するため仲間を利用することも厭わない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25901","sourceWorkId":"7026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"永远神剑：第五位　『慧眼』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"守护神兽：特伦托「贤明巨人」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"集结着望等人的「旅団」首领。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以全灭「带来光明之人」为目的，把优先拯救危险的时间分枝作为行动。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拥有像是看透一切般的眼睛，且不被他人看透自己的心思，除给出指示外其余时间基本不说话。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"为达目的即使利用同伴也不在乎。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11508"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/240642be44b27b0bb45b6348e08ded194c65c6c5b56fb8e76c7c92970d1be315.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b5799fb5ee5120f54fac8efc7c1df2a18a18217751a5984fc7ea36488a048ce2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"皇 帝","creatorId":"vndb:s55","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s55","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s55","name":"立花 慎之介","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8046","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42633","characterName":"レーメ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42633"},"originalCharacterName":"レーメ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f9b3f2aba048febcd70c2260a8f08d6f64c27b86cfcec8ec5b1d6078ac497ac6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5